	(descr "Microchip DSC1123 family LVDS MEMS oscillator, SMD3225-6P (3.2x2.5mm, 6-pad) land. Pulled via easyeda2kicad from LCSC C617173 (DSC1123CI2-125.0000) — a SAME-PACKAGE SIBLING of the target DSC1123BL5-125.0000 (identical SMD3225-6P body per LCSC listing; only the stability/temperature bin differs, which does not change the physical land). Pin function assignment (1=EN,2=NC,3=GND,4=OUT+,5=OUT-,6=VDD,PAD=GND) verified against the Microchip DSC1103/23 datasheet Table 2-1, which is identical across all package-size variants of this family. FLAG: the exact DSC1123BL5 LCSC/distributor C-number is unconfirmed — verify at BOM sourcing.")
